Name: iGhostVT
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Ghostty-powered terminal for jailbroken iOS and visionOS
 Terminal emulator built on libghostty's terminal core with a host-managed
 I/O backend. Packaged for both roothide and rootless bootstraps, for iOS
 (iphoneos-*) and for Apple Vision Pro (xros-*); the architecture field says
 which build this is.
 .
 Shells are spawned by the bundled ighostvtd daemon and survive app
 relaunches; SSH transport is planned on the same transport interface.
